{"id":"437f8f48cb6b32a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-function-composition.md","title":"Function Composition","display":"df-function-composition — Function Composition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-function-composition","aliases":["58-df-function-composition"],"display":"df-function-composition — Function Composition","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-function-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-function-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-composition — Function Composition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\in V\">\\(f \\in V\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g \\in V\">\\(g \\in V\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in V\">\\(h\\in V\\)</span> (candidate composite function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\in V\">\\(A \\in V\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\in V\">\\(B \\in V\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C \\in V\">\\(C \\in V\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compose}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compose}_S\\)</span> (composition predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function-composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compose}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,C)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(h(x)=g(f(x)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function-composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compose}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,C)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(h(x)=g(f(x)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: A \\to B\">\\(f: A \\to B\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f, A, B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f, A, B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g: B \\to C\">\\(g: B \\to C\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(g, B, C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(g, B, C)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compose}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compose}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\)</span> makes the composite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> an explicit argument and entails <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:A\\to C\">\\(h:A\\to C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}\">\\(g^{-1}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的逆关系（而非双射情形下的逆函数）</li>\n<li>The definition uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(y)=z\">\\(g(y)=z\\)</span> directly; no inverse relation is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f \\in V$ ($f$ 是函数, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g \\in V$ ($g$ 是函数, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A \\in V$ ($A$ 是集合, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B \\in V$ ($B$ 是集合, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C \\in V$ ($C$ 是集合, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"C \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compose}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function-composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compose}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,C)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(h(x)=g(f(x)))","display":true},{"tex":"f: A \\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f, A, B)","display":false},{"tex":"g: B \\to C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(g, B, C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compose}_S(h,g,f,A,B,C)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"h:A\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"g^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"g(y)=z","display":fals